abstract: >-
  ASD3DP-DG is a four-channel 3D-printer operating-sound dataset for anomalous
  sound detection under domain shift. It covers three printer builds and
  includes session and clip annotations linked to collection evidence.
keywords:
  - anomalous sound detection
  - 3D printing
  - domain shift
  - multichannel audio
  - machine condition monitoring
url: "https://github.com/LUDO-Lab-Research/ASD3DP-DG"
